# armour/shared/pauldron_roll6_r: the legend ROLL pauldron on the right shoulder (roll.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# padded rolls grown great: three (legend four) stuffed tubes stacked down the shoulder, each lit along its top
# and shaded under it, a dark seam between them; round at the top and the foot (QUILTED, cloth; the ROUND mass).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: N the seams between the rolls, P the rolls' lit tops, R the last roll.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron roll.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

